  contraband: []
  boothLines:
  - Howdy. You speak English? Good. Good for you. Real proud of you.
  - "Been down in Ju\xE1rez getting my teeth done. Eight crowns, three hundred bucks.
    Don't tell anybody, they'll all want to go."
  - Now don't take this personal, but y'all need to build that wall higher. Not you.
    You're one of the good ones.
  lineIfApproved: Appreciate it, amigo. See? System works when the right folks run
    it.
  lineIfRejected: Rejected? I'm AMERICAN. I'll be on the news by tonight. Not in
    a good way. For YOU.
  lineIfImprisoned: I was BORN here! ...Is this about the wall thing? That was a
    joke! Mostly!
